# tally 2.2.1 P35 (L §8.2 l.2248, "an entry is listed under a result exactly when a read in its set gave it", whatever
# the form of the line, its outcome, or the way a movement came not to count): B1, a refused flows lists the pins its refusal
# read: f and fz RUN-DIV with pinned: (review g2 min/b1). tally 2.2.1 before W8: no line.
=== b1.tally
model b1
  tally 2
  on 2026-01-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..
input z: int
input pay: money PLN
input w: date
move bad: transfers
  on w
  leg cash from world to konto amount round(pay / z, minor(PLN), half-even)
version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  opening[konto] = 500.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "s"
  pay = 100.00 PLN "s"
  z = 0 "s"
  w = 2026-03-10 "s"
ask b: bal(konto, 2026-03-31) with w = 2026-03-12
ask f: flows(konto, 2026-03) with w = 2026-03-12
ask fz: flows(konto, 2026-03) with z = 0
=== expect f fz
f: refused: RUN-DIV division by zero
  pinned: w = 2026-03-12
  cut 2026-01-01
fz: refused: RUN-DIV division by zero
  pinned: z = 0
  cut 2026-01-01
